  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-04-18T07:28:25.254Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Open the Quick Menu.\n\n2. Navigate to the \"Here\" icon (View information about your current instance. Double click to view in Main Menu.).\n\n3. Click on the \"Users\" header to minimize it.\n\n4. Click on the \"Users\" header to unminimize it again.\n\n5. Scroll down. (If you then scroll up again, the issue resolves itself.)\n\nExpected behavior: My status should appear as \"Online\" in the users list in the current instance information.\n\nActual behavior: I see a placeholder text \"Status\" for some topmost listed users in the current instance.\n\nPlease see my attached video tutorial for reproduction.",
